601
00:45:09,206 --> 00:45:11,706
はい、皆さん息は大丈夫そうですか？
Alright, is everyone holding up okay with their breathing?

602
00:45:11,706 --> 00:45:12,806
ですか？
Are you?

603
00:45:12,806 --> 00:45:13,906
ギリ！
Barely!

604
00:45:13,906 --> 00:45:17,006
ギリ？ もうちょっと喋る？ もうちょっと喋る？
Barely? Want to chat a bit more? Chat a bit more?

605
00:45:17,006 --> 00:45:19,406
ギリ大丈夫、でも行けそう！
Barely okay, but we can do this!

606
00:45:19,406 --> 00:45:22,106
はい！ということでね、じゃあみんなまだまだ...
Alright! So then, everyone, we're not...

607
00:45:22,106 --> 00:45:25,806
まだまだ！ まだまだ終わりませんよ！ まだまだ何かあるかもしれないですよ！
Not yet! It's not over yet! There might still be something else coming!

608
00:45:25,806 --> 00:45:33,106
はい！ ハッシュタグこれもお願いします！ 祝ってください！ #ReGLOSS2周年！
Yes! Please post using this hashtag too! Please celebrate with us! #ReGLOSS2ndAnniversary!

609
00:45:33,106 --> 00:45:35,806
はい！ じゃあ次の曲、いいですかー？
Alright! Then for the next song, are you ready?

610
00:45:35,806 --> 00:45:38,106
次の楽曲はなんと...
The next song is actually...

611
00:45:38,106 --> 00:45:43,306
本日公開されたばかりの...あの曲！
that song that was just released today!

612
00:45:43,306 --> 00:45:44,906
うわー！
Whoa~!

613
00:45:44,906 --> 00:45:47,606
じゃあ、立ち位置につきますかー
Alright, shall we get into our positions?

614
00:45:47,606 --> 00:45:52,106
はい！ なんの曲かなー？
Okay! What song could it be?

615
00:45:53,606 --> 00:45:57,306
それでは聴いてください、『アワータイムイエロー』
Now then, please listen to "Hour Time Yellow".

616
00:46:11,206 --> 00:46:13,406
ソラをボエで挑む人生ゲーム
Challenging the game of life by winging it,

617
00:46:13,406 --> 00:46:15,906
言い訳めいたハートに従って
following a heart full of excuses.

618
00:46:15,906 --> 00:46:18,306
現実は半即興なプロットです
Reality is a semi-improvised plot,

619
00:46:18,306 --> 00:46:21,506
取り憑かれるオーバーな芝居
possessed by overly dramatic acting.

620
00:46:21,506 --> 00:46:24,106
世渡り上手なあの子はね
That girl who's so good at navigating life, you see,

621
00:46:24,106 --> 00:46:27,106
二度と被った猫外せない
can never take off that innocent mask again.

622
00:46:27,106 --> 00:46:30,506
痛みを知ってしまった magician
A magician who has come to know pain

623
00:46:30,506 --> 00:46:33,306
手の内は未だ明かせない
still cannot reveal their trick.

624
00:46:33,306 --> 00:46:38,606
Yellow yellow ゼロからループ点滅するピリオド
Yellow, yellow, looping from zero, a blinking period.

625
00:46:38,606 --> 00:46:41,906
Yellow yellow 染まる紅い化粧
Yellow, yellow, stained in crimson makeup.

626
00:46:41,906 --> 00:46:45,106
I wonder if I can make it or not

627
00:46:45,106 --> 00:46:50,906
例えツキに見放されても No worries 私には私がついてる
Even if luck abandons me, no worries, I've got myself.

628
00:46:54,606 --> 00:47:01,106
宵が醒めるまであと少しだけ 真のアイ捉える残像
Just a little more until the night wears off, catching an afterimage of true love.

629
00:47:01,106 --> 00:47:06,306
Slow and steady wins the race 次の季節を越え Blooming blooming
Slow and steady wins the race, crossing into the next season, blooming blooming.

630
00:47:07,106 --> 00:47:12,906
どうかこの音を止めないで
Please don't stop this sound.

631
00:47:17,306 --> 00:47:24,306
Hourtime yellow yellow Let it blow, let it blow ずっとの Stay gold
Hourtime yellow yellow, let it blow, let it blow, staying gold forever.

632
00:47:24,306 --> 00:47:30,606
Hourtime yellow yellow Let it blow, let it blow Let's enjoy the moment

633
00:47:31,906 --> 00:47:37,106
Look into the mirror 絡まってる蜘蛛の糸
Look into the mirror, caught in a spider's web.

634
00:47:37,106 --> 00:47:42,906
It happens all the time 踊らされたって構わない
It happens all the time, I don't care if I'm made to dance.

635
00:47:42,906 --> 00:47:48,906
夜を日に継いで 時を編んで明け暮れて
Working day and night, weaving time from dusk to dawn,

636
00:47:48,906 --> 00:47:53,906
Always be honest 永遠に変わらないもの
Always be honest, things that never change.

637
00:47:53,906 --> 00:47:59,306
Yellow yellow 手を取り合えばそこに理由は要らない
Yellow, yellow, if we hold hands, no reasons are needed.

638
00:47:59,306 --> 00:48:02,706
Yellow yellow 染まる紅い化粧
Yellow, yellow, stained in crimson makeup.

639
00:48:02,706 --> 00:48:05,306
A smile suits you best

640
00:48:05,306 --> 00:48:10,906
幾つになっても Changeless 希望 夢は人知れず
No matter how old I get, changeless, hopes and dreams remain hidden.

641
00:48:10,906 --> 00:48:16,306
歪で数奇な運命や 人生ごと受け入れる
Accepting distorted, eventful destiny and life as a whole.

642
00:48:16,306 --> 00:48:19,106
心機一転 二転 三転 詠んで
A sudden turn of heart, two turns, three turns, reading the room,

643
00:48:19,106 --> 00:48:21,906
第五感で Lock on
locking on with the fifth sense.

644
00:48:21,906 --> 00:48:24,606
右見て左見て Pause 前だけ向いて Go on
Look right, look left, pause, face forward and go on.

645
00:48:24,606 --> 00:48:27,106
歌い続ける 24/7
Continuing to sing 24/7.

646
00:48:27,106 --> 00:48:29,906
終着地点は Eden or Heaven?
Is the final destination Eden or Heaven?

647
00:48:29,906 --> 00:48:32,906
No time to waste "今"だけを信じてる
No time to waste, believing only in "now".

648
00:48:32,906 --> 00:48:38,606
最後のフィナーレまで共に進め
Pressing forward together until the final finale.

649
00:48:38,606 --> 00:48:45,106
宵が醒めるまであと少しだけ 真のアイ捉える残像
Just a little more until the night wears off, catching an afterimage of true love.

650
00:48:45,106 --> 00:48:50,306
Slow and steady wins the race 次の季節を越え Blooming blooming
Slow and steady wins the race, crossing into the next season, blooming blooming.

651
00:48:50,306 --> 00:48:56,106
どうかこの音を止めないで
Please don't stop this sound.

652
00:48:56,106 --> 00:49:02,606
Hourtime yellow yellow Let it blow, let it blow ずっとの Stay gold
Hourtime yellow yellow, let it blow, let it blow, staying gold forever.

653
00:49:02,606 --> 00:49:09,106
Hourtime yellow yellow Let it blow, let it blow Let's enjoy the moment

654
00:49:20,106 --> 00:49:24,106
一振りのダンス、一瞬の視線、一拍の鼓動
[A stroke of dance, a momentary glance, a single beat of heart]

655
00:49:25,106 --> 00:49:28,606
一秒一秒が永遠に鳴り響く
[Every single second echoes into eternity]

656
00:49:29,106 --> 00:49:31,606
ReGLOSSが描いていく“今”を切り取った一枚一枚の連続
[A series of moments capturing the "now" drawn by ReGLOSS]

657
00:49:32,106 --> 00:49:35,106
そのすべてが連なり 観る人の記憶に焼きついていく
[Connecting them all to burn into the memories of those who watch]

658
00:49:36,106 --> 00:49:40,106
2025.12.16 Tue. Flashpoint ReGLOSS 1st Live

659
00:49:41,106 --> 00:49:44,106
ARIAKE ARENA

660
00:49:58,106 --> 00:50:00,606
それぞれの光が響き合い、世界をかたちづくる
[Their respective lights resonate together, shaping the world]

661
00:50:01,106 --> 00:50:03,606
ReGLOSSはその瞬間を音楽とダンスで伝える
[ReGLOSS conveys that moment through music and dance]

662
00:50:10,304 --> 00:50:12,154
はーい！
Yay!

663
00:50:12,254 --> 00:50:15,954
ということで！みんな見た？見た？見た？
So, did everyone see it? Did you see it?

664
00:50:16,254 --> 00:50:17,654
やばい！
Oh my gosh!

665
00:50:17,654 --> 00:50:21,254
12月16日、有明アリーナ...
On December 16th, at Ariake Ari...

666
00:50:21,254 --> 00:50:24,954
もう一回！テイク2、テイク2、テイク2！
One more time! Take 2, Take 2, Take 2!

667
00:50:24,954 --> 00:50:32,254
もう一回行こう！うん！12月16日、有明アリーナにて！
Let me try again! Yep! On December 16th, at Ariake Arena!

668
00:50:32,454 --> 00:50:35,454
ReGLOSS 1st Live『Flashpoint』の開催が決定いたしましたー！
ReGLOSS 1st Live "Flashpoint" has been announced!

669
00:50:35,454 --> 00:50:38,954
やったー！
Yay!

670
00:50:38,954 --> 00:50:43,454
すごい！すごい！すごい！
Amazing! Amazing! Amazing!

671
00:50:43,454 --> 00:50:47,454
え、現地ライブってことだよね？そうだよ！
Wait, does that mean an in-person concert? Yes, it is!

672
00:50:47,454 --> 00:50:51,254
しかもめちゃくちゃでかい会場だよ！そうだよね！
And it's at a huge venue! Right?!

673
00:50:51,254 --> 00:50:55,954
やばい！夢が叶うってこと？！
Oh my gosh! Does this mean our dream is coming true?!

674
00:50:55,954 --> 00:51:02,954
みんな、ありがとう！応援してくれたみんなのおかげだね！
Thank you, everyone! It's all thanks to everyone who supported us!

675
00:51:02,954 --> 00:51:09,454
1個目の夢が叶うかもしれないんだ！頑張ろう！
One of our dreams might come true! Let's do our best!

676
00:51:09,454 --> 00:51:19,954
はい！で、こちらのライブなんですけれども、2ndアルバムで描いた世界観に連動して、ReGLOSSの「今」を記憶に焼き付ける、というテーマになっています！
Yes! As for this concert, in line with the world described in our 2nd album, the theme is to engrave the "present" of ReGLOSS into your memories!

677
00:51:19,954 --> 00:51:25,954
つまり！まさに今の私たちの集大成となるライブでございます！
In other words! It's a concert that serves as the culmination of who we are right now!

678
00:51:25,954 --> 00:51:31,954
イエーイ！で、ちょっとね、ライブのキービジュアルも改めてお見せしちゃいたい...
Yay! And we'd like to show you the key visual for the concert again...

679
00:51:31,954 --> 00:51:38,954
こちら！デデン！うわー！かっこいい！ねー！
Here it is! Ta-da! Whoa! So cool! Right?!

680
00:51:38,954 --> 00:51:48,254
こちらのキービジュアルはね、ライブのテーマに合わせてライブパフォーマンス中のReGLOSSを切り取ったイメージのデザインとなっています！
This key visual is designed around the theme of the concert, capturing ReGLOSS mid-performance!

681
00:51:48,254 --> 00:51:54,454
へぇ〜！ステキ！なんかまた普段のReGLOSSとは違った一面な感じがしたね！
Whoa! Lovely! It feels like showing a different side of ReGLOSS than usual!

682
00:51:54,454 --> 00:52:04,454
今回のライブのハッシュタグは #ReGLOSS_1stLive です！いっぱいポストして皆で盛り上がりましょう！
The hashtag for this concert is #ReGLOSS_1stLive! Please post a lot so we can all get excited together!

683
00:52:04,454 --> 00:52:08,454
お願いします！
Please do!

684
00:52:08,454 --> 00:52:18,954
さて、そんな中、皆さんが気になっているであろうチケット情報を皆さんにお見せしようかなと思います！チケット情報はこちら！デデン！
Now then, we'd like to share the ticket information that you're probably all curious about! Here's the ticket info! Ta-da!

685
00:52:18,954 --> 00:52:26,454
はい！チケットはS席、A席、B席の3種類です！
Yes! There are 3 types of tickets: S seats, A seats, and B seats!

686
00:52:26,454 --> 00:52:31,954
1次先行はこのあと21時からスタートです！
The 1st pre-order sales start tonight at 21:00!

687
00:52:31,954 --> 00:52:37,454
先着ではございません！抽選でございます！焦らずにお申し込みください！
It's not first-come, first-served! It's a lottery! Please apply without rushing!

688
00:52:37,454 --> 00:52:44,454
さらに「会場には行けないよ〜」という人のために配信チケットもご用意しました！
Furthermore, for those who can't make it to the venue, we also prepared streaming tickets!

689
00:52:44,454 --> 00:52:49,454
こちらもこのあと21時から販売開始です！
These will also go on sale tonight at 21:00!

690
00:52:49,454 --> 00:52:52,954
続いて、会場のエリアマップはこちら！ジャン！
Next, here is the venue seat map! Ta-da!

691
00:52:52,954 --> 00:53:01,954
S席、A席、B席がそれぞれどこになるのかはこちらをチェックしてください！
Please check here to see where S, A, and B seats are located!

692
00:53:01,954 --> 00:53:11,454
エリアマップはこのあとホロライブ公式Xでもポストするので、詳しくはそちらをご確認ください！そしてみんな、喜べ！トレンド1位！
The seat map will also be posted on the official Hololive X account later, so check there for details! And everyone, rejoice! We're #1 on trending!

693
00:53:11,454 --> 00:53:17,454
やったー！嬉しい！ありがとう！
Yay! So happy! Thank you!

694
00:53:17,454 --> 00:53:25,454
ありがとう！2周年も祝ってくれて嬉しいな！ねー！
Thank you! We're so glad you're celebrating our 2nd anniversary with us too! Right?!

695
00:53:25,454 --> 00:53:34,454
そしてそして！ライブのグッズについては10月10日のReGLOSSの公式配信で発表します！
And also! Details about concert merchandise will be announced during the official ReGLOSS stream on October 10th!

696
00:53:34,454 --> 00:53:40,454
楽しみ！素敵なグッズがいっぱいあるので見逃さないでね！
Can't wait! There are lots of wonderful merch items, so don't miss out!

697
00:53:40,454 --> 00:53:50,454
そしてそして！今回発表したライブの情報や次回のグッズの情報は特設サイトにて掲載いたします！
And also! The concert information announced today and future merch details will be posted on the special website!

698
00:53:50,454 --> 00:54:01,454
特設サイト...あ、うちら事前に行ったよね！言ってたかも！
The special website... Ah, we talked about it beforehand! We might have mentioned it!

699
00:54:01,454 --> 00:54:07,954
はい！すごくかっこいいサイトなんで、ぜひとも覗いてみてください！
Yes! It's a super cool site, so please be sure to check it out!

700
00:54:07,954 --> 00:54:15,454
特設サイトは「ReGLOSS 1st Live」で検索をお願いします！
Search "ReGLOSS 1st Live" to find the special website!

701
00:54:15,454 --> 00:54:22,954
今後も追加情報を更新していくので、ブックマークとチェックをよろしくお願いします！
We will keep updating with more info, so please bookmark and check back often!

702
00:54:22,954 --> 00:54:30,454
現地ですってよ！やばいね！どうよ、みんな？
They said it's an in-person concert! That's crazy! How are you all feeling?

703
00:54:30,454 --> 00:54:39,454
はい！莉々華はデビューの時から言ってるんだけど、ダンスも歌も自信がなかったし、得意じゃないって思ってた莉々華が...
Yes! Ririka has been saying this since debut, but I wasn't confident in dancing or singing, and thought I wasn't good at it...

704
00:54:39,454 --> 00:54:46,454
ちょっとずつそれぞれを好きになっていけていて、みんなにちゃんと成長した姿を見てもらいたいって思ってて...
...but step by step, I've come to enjoy them, and I really want everyone to see how much I've grown...

705
00:54:46,454 --> 00:54:57,454
その夢が新しい現地ライブっていう場で叶うのかもしれないって思ったらめちゃくちゃ嬉しいです！
...and thinking that dream might come true at this new live event makes me so incredibly happy!

706
00:54:57,454 --> 00:55:00,454
ありがとう！
Thank you!

707
00:55:00,729 --> 00:55:02,029
と...
Um...

708
00:55:02,029 --> 00:55:03,229
え、奏は
Kanade...

709
00:55:03,229 --> 00:55:06,829
なんか正直まだ実感が湧いてなくって
honestly still hasn't fully registered it yet,

710
00:55:07,429 --> 00:55:09,529
現地ライブ...
a live venue show...

711
00:55:09,829 --> 00:55:13,829
本当に... 本当に...みたいな
Like, 'Really...? Really...?'

712
00:55:13,929 --> 00:55:18,029
なんか実感が本当に湧かなくて...
It really hasn't sunk in...

713
00:55:18,729 --> 00:55:24,429
でもなんか、ずっとさ現地ライブしたい、したいって言ってきて、いざ決定！ってなって
But we kept saying we wanted a live venue show, and when it was finally decided...

714
00:55:24,729 --> 00:55:29,629
世に出て、なんか本当に不思議な気持ち
and announced to the world, it felt so surreal.

715
00:55:29,829 --> 00:55:32,829
めちゃくちゃ嬉しいんだけどね！
I'm super happy, though!

716
00:55:32,829 --> 00:55:37,529
なんか夢のようで、なんか逆に何も感じないような...
It feels like a dream, so in a way, it's hard to process...

717
00:55:37,929 --> 00:55:44,929
じわじわ後から、うわー！嬉しい！ってなると思うんだけど...
I think it'll gradually hit me later, like 'Whoa, I'm so happy!'...

718
00:55:44,929 --> 00:55:46,729
おめでとう！ありがとう！
Congratulations! Thank you!

719
00:55:46,729 --> 00:55:49,229
みんなのおかげです！
It's all thanks to everyone!

720
00:55:49,229 --> 00:55:50,729
番長はどう？
How about you, Bancho?

721
00:55:50,729 --> 00:55:54,029
いや、同じくね、実感が湧かなくて...
Yeah, same here, it hasn't quite set in...

722
00:55:54,329 --> 00:55:58,929
本当なんだろ、夢見心地でよく分からないけど
It really feels like a dream, so I don't fully get it yet, but...

723
00:55:58,929 --> 00:56:03,229
でも、もうあと3ヶ月くらいしたら...
in about 3 months, though...

724
00:56:03,529 --> 00:56:06,729
ReGLOSSのみんなが目の前にいて...
everyone in ReGLOSS will be right in front of us...

725
00:56:06,829 --> 00:56:08,729
パフォーマンス...
performing...

726
00:56:09,229 --> 00:56:13,729
みんなが目の前にいて「キャー！」ってやって来られるってことでしょ？
and everyone will be right there cheering 'Yay!' right?

727
00:56:13,829 --> 00:56:19,729
ってやって来られちゃうと思ったら...
Thinking about everyone coming to see us...

728
00:56:19,729 --> 00:56:24,229
もうすっごい嬉しいですし、本当にありがとうございます！
makes me so happy, thank you all so much!

729
00:56:24,529 --> 00:56:27,929
嬉しいね！そしてらでんちゃんは？
That's wonderful! And how about Raden-chan?

730
00:56:27,929 --> 00:56:34,229
はい！現地ライブということで、12月少し早めのReGLOSSからのクリスマスプレゼントということで...
Yes! A live venue show, like an early Christmas gift from ReGLOSS in December...

731
00:56:34,229 --> 00:56:37,729
現地ライブさせていただくんですけれども...
We get to perform a live venue show, but...

732
00:56:37,729 --> 00:56:41,729
まさかね、まさかまさかの現地ライブで...
Never in a million years did I expect a live venue show...

733
00:56:41,729 --> 00:56:45,729
本当にこんなありがたい機会がいただけるって、生きててなかなか無いじゃない？
To get such a wonderful opportunity is a rare thing in life, right?

734
00:56:45,729 --> 00:56:47,229
無いよ！無いよ！
It really is!

735
00:56:47,229 --> 00:56:51,529
そう！だからすごくありがたいなと思うし、嬉しいなと思いますし...
Right! So I feel so grateful and happy about it...

736
00:56:51,529 --> 00:56:54,529
今ね、絶賛こうレッスンでね...
And right now, we're in the middle of lessons...

737
00:56:54,529 --> 00:56:57,729
ライブに向けて我々頑張っておりますので...
We're practicing hard for the live show...

738
00:56:57,729 --> 00:57:01,529
ぜひ今後も応援してくれるととっても嬉しいです！
so we'd be thrilled if you keep supporting us!

739
00:57:01,529 --> 00:57:04,229
皆さん本当にありがとうございます！
Thank you all so much!

740
00:57:04,229 --> 00:57:07,229
ありがとうございますー！
Thank you so much!

741
00:57:08,229 --> 00:57:10,729
ねー、いやー本当ライブ嬉しいね！
Yeah, I'm really so happy about the live show!

742
00:57:10,729 --> 00:57:12,229
最高だね！
It's the best!

743
00:57:12,229 --> 00:57:18,529
でもその、ライブのためってわけでもないけどさ、いろんな楽曲を歌わせていただいていて...
Not just for the live show, but we've gotten to sing various songs...

744
00:57:18,529 --> 00:57:22,729
今回「Our Time Yellow」もね、新しくリリースさせていただいたわけなんですけれども...
and we recently released 'Our Time Yellow' as well...

745
00:57:22,729 --> 00:57:26,529
ちょっとその感想も話しちゃおうか、ここでね！「Our Time Yellow」のね！
Let's share our thoughts on 'Our Time Yellow' right here!

746
00:57:26,529 --> 00:57:29,229
じゃあ逆順で行く？らでんちゃんどう？
Shall we go in reverse order? How about you, Raden-chan?

747
00:57:29,229 --> 00:57:32,729
あ！らでんはね、MV出たじゃん？
Ah, for Raden, the MV came out, right?

748
00:57:32,729 --> 00:57:37,729
MV出たから、いろんなものが素敵なんだけど、中でもらでんは歌詞がすっごい好きで...
Everything in the MV is wonderful, but I especially love the lyrics...

749
00:57:37,729 --> 00:57:44,929
ちょっとMV見て「あ、良い曲だな」とか「MVめちゃめちゃ動いていいな」と思った方は...
If you watched the MV and thought 'Oh, what a great song' or 'The animation is so active'...

750
00:57:44,929 --> 00:57:49,729
もう一回次は歌詞に注目してくれるとすごく嬉しいな、なんて思います！
I'd be so happy if you focus on the lyrics next time!

751
00:57:50,729 --> 00:57:52,729
番長は？
How about Bancho?

752
00:57:52,729 --> 00:57:56,529
いや、もうとにかくリズムとメロディが好きでしてね！
I just love the rhythm and melody so much!

753
00:57:56,529 --> 00:57:59,729
ずっとやってる！
You've been doing that motion non-stop!

754
00:57:59,729 --> 00:58:01,729
疾走感があって...
It has such a sense of speed...

755
00:58:01,729 --> 00:58:08,229
乗ってる言葉のメロディも全部リズム良かったり、チュウンチュウンって言ったり...
The melody of the words fits the rhythm so well, with cool dynamic sounds...

756
00:58:08,229 --> 00:58:13,529
激しいやん、移り変わりが！飽きの来ない展開というかさ！
The transitions are so intense, it never gets boring!

757
00:58:13,529 --> 00:58:16,229
なんかもうすごいメロディ大好きっす！
I just really love the melody!

758
00:58:16,229 --> 00:58:18,729
ぜひ聴いてください！
Please give it a listen!

759
00:58:18,729 --> 00:58:23,229
奏はまず曲がものすごく大好きだし...
Kanade loves the song so much first of all...

760
00:58:23,229 --> 00:58:27,529
今日みんなとさ、初めてMVを見たじゃないですか！
